    <div class="page-header-info">
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Westmuir Volunteering</h1>
        <p>
          Contributing to the life of the village in a way that offers fun, friendship and a huge sense of satisfaction
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>

  <h2>There are 3 main areas in which you can become a Volunteer</h2>

  <div class="breakout volunteer-columns">
    <div>
      <p>The Village Hall and Car Park</p>
      <ul>
        <li class="style10">Hall Maintenance</li>
        <li class="style10">Car Park Maintenance</li>
        <li class="style10">Fundraising Events</li>
        <li class="style10">Administration Roles</li>
        <li class="style10">Financial Roles</li>
        <li class="style10">Hall Committee Membership</li>
        <li class="style10">Be a 'Friend of the Hall'</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p>The Community Development Trust and Woodland</p>
      <ul>
        <li class="style10">Woodland Management</li>
        <li class="style10">Woodland Car Park</li>
        <li class="style10">Paths and Boardwalks</li>
        <li class="style10">Strimming &amp; Grass Cutting</li>
        <li class="style10">Litter Picking</li>
        <li class="style10">Financial Roles</li>
        <li class="style10">Become a Trust Member</li>
        <li class="style10">Join the Trust Board of Directors</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Taking Care of the Village Defibrillator</p>
      <ul>
        <li class="style10">Help Raise Awareness</li>
        <li class="style10">Help with Weekly Checks</li>
        <li class="style10">Kiosk Cleaning</li>
        <li class="style10">Administration Role</li>
        <li class="style10">Help with defibrillator / first aid awareness sessions</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="breakout volunteer-footer">
    <div class="lh-3">
      Just email us at
      <a href="mailto: volunteers@westmuir.org.uk">volunteers&#64;westmuir.org.uk </a>

      and we'll get right back to you.
    </div>
    <div>
      You'll be made most welcome and you won't regret it ! Our existing volunteers are a friendly bunch of folk who
      enjoy getting hands-on and contributing to the life of the village in a way that offers fun, friendship and a huge
      sense of satisfaction.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
